%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 45c78dfed53f4022b31bed338c31f6c6, type: 3}
  m_Name: LocalizationData
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  entries:
  - key: tutorial.timeLabel
    english: 'Time to level begin: '
    polish: "Czas do rozpocz\u0119cia poziomu: "
  - key: tutorial.button.next
    english: Next
    polish: "Nast\u0119pny"
  - key: tutorial.button.prev
    english: Previous
    polish: Poprzedni
  - key: tutorial.button.play
    english: Play!
    polish: Graj!
  - key: tutorial.level1.line0
    english: 'Welcome to the next session.

      Why so agitated?

      You do
      not recognize us...

      That is alright.

      We will start from the beginning.'
    polish: "Witamy na kolejnej sesji.\nCo tak niewyra\u017Anie wygl\u0105dasz?\nNie
      poznajesz nas. Ok, w porz\u0105dku. Zaczniemy od pocz\u0105tku."
  - key: tutorial.level1.line1
    english: 'You have come here because of your troubles with memory,

      and
      we are your therapists.

      Sounds familiar? No?

      Have a look at this,
      then.'
    polish: "Przyszed\u0142e\u015B tutaj ze wzgl\u0119du na problemy z pami\u0119ci\u0105,
      a my jeste\u015Bmy Twoimi terapeutami.\nBrzmi znajomo? Nie? No, dobra."
  - key: tutorial.level1.line2
    english: 'Here is our agreement, and this is your signature. We have highlighed
      the most important part.


      "I hereby agree for

      unconventional
      methods of

      psychological treatment.'
    polish: "Tutaj jest nasza umowa, a tutaj Tw\xF3j podpis. Zaznaczyli\u015Bmy najwa\u017Cniejszy
      fragment.\n\n\"Zgadzam si\u0119 na niekonwencjonalne metody terapii psychologicznej."
  - key: tutorial.level1.line3
    english: 'Ok, if everything is clear now,

      let''s remind you of some

      psychological
      basics.

      Our therapy is grounded in psychoanalisys, developed by Sigmund
      Freud'
    polish: "Ok, skoro ju\u017C wszystko jasne, przypomnimy Ci kilka zagadnie\u0144
      z psychologii.\nNasza terapia opiera si\u0119 na psychoanalizie, kt\xF3rej
      autorem jest Zygmunt Freud."
  - key: tutorial.level1.line4
    english: 'According to his theory, human psychology works on three levels: conscious,
      preconscious,

      and unconscious.

      The greatest influence on later
      life comes from one''s childhood.'
    polish: "W jego koncepcji psychika dzia\u0142a na trzech poziomach. \u015Awiadomo\u015Bci,
      przed\u015Bwiadomo\u015Bci i nie\u015Bwiadomo\u015Bci.\nNajwi\u0119kszy wp\u0142yw
      na p\xF3\u017Aniejsze \u017Cycie ma dzieci\u0144stwo."
  - key: tutorial.level1.line5
    english: 'So, this is where we are heading now.

      To the childhood,

      through
      all three levels.

      Get your gear and get going,

      there is no time
      to waste!'
    polish: "No, wi\u0119c w\u0142a\u015Bnie tam sie udajemy.\nDo dzieci\u0144stwa
      poprzez wszystkie trzy poziomy.\nOdpalaj sprz\u0119t i lecimy, nie ma czasu!"
  - key: tutorial.level1.line6
    english: 'We will be in touch all the time.

      Worry not, we have been doing
      this

      a million times.'
    polish: "Przez ca\u0142y czas b\u0119dziemy w kontakcie.\nNie b\xF3j si\u0119,
      robili\u015Bmy to miliony razy."
  - key: tutorial.level3.line0
    english: 'Hello again!

      Well, next time better hurry up, will you?

      You
      know, these therapies are expensive these days.

      This time you''ll go
      to the consciousness.

      It is the outermost level.

      This means that
      your control will be least impaired.

      On this level, you''ll meet your
      favourite bunnies,

      which you fed lettuce so willingly.

      We don''t
      know, what happened to them.

      It''s your head, after all.

      Anyway,
      regular lettuce won''t work on them now.

      Remember that your health regenerates!'
    polish: "Witaj ponownie!\nNo, nast\u0119pnym razem lepiej si\u0119 pospiesz.\nWiesz
      ile te terapie kosztuj\u0105 w dzisiejszych czasach.\nTym razem udasz si\u0119
      do \u015Bwiadomo\u015Bci.\nJest to najbardziej zewn\u0119trzny poziom.\nOznacza
      to, \u017Ce twoja kontrola b\u0119dzie najwi\u0119ksza.\nNa tym poziomie znowu
      spotkasz swoje ulubione zaj\u0105czki,\nkt\xF3re tak ch\u0119tnie dokarmia\u0142e\u015B
      sa\u0142at\u0105.\nNie wiemy, co im si\u0119 sta\u0142o.\nTo Twoja g\u0142owa.\nW
      ka\u017Cdym razie zwyk\u0142\u0105 sa\u0142at\u0105 na pewno ich nie przekupisz.\nPami\u0119taj,
      \u017Ce twoje zdrowie si\u0119 regeneruje!"
  - key: tutorial.level5.line0
    english: 'Well, well, congratulations!

      "We have to go deeper!"

      Remember
      that movie, Inception? Ah, right. You have memory issues.

      We have to
      write this down.

      Now it''s time for the preconsciousness. This is everything,
      that you suppress.

      Every tear, every need of consolation in your favourite
      teddybear''s embrace.

      But those teddys aren''t that cute anymore.

      But
      you have your Superpower! You just have to press L2 (left trigger)!

      For
      a few seconds, 5 tops.

      The longer, the more enemies you''ll strike down.

      Sadly,
      every use of Superpower will tire you for a bit.

      You won''t be able
      to shoot that fast and hard.

      It will go back to normal after a while,
      though. Let''s begin!'
    polish: "No, no, gratulacje!\n\"Musimy zej\u015B\u0107 g\u0142\u0119biej!\"\nPami\u0119tasz
      Incepcj\u0119? A, no fakt. Masz probelmy z pami\u0119ci\u0105.\nMusimy to sobie
      gdzie\u015B zapisa\u0107.\nTeraz pora na przed\u015Bwiadomo\u015B\u0107. Czyli
      wszystko, co t\u0142umisz.\nKa\u017Cdy p\u0142acz, szukanie pocieszenia w obj\u0119ciach
      ulubionego misia.\nTylko, \u017Ce teraz te misie nie s\u0105 ju\u017C takie
      s\u0142odkie.\nAle masz Supermoc! Wystarczy, \u017Ce przytrzymasz przycisk
      L2 z ty\u0142u pada (lewy trigger)!\nPrzez kilka sekund, maksymalnie pi\u0119\u0107.\nIm
      d\u0142u\u017Cej, tym wi\u0119cej wrog\xF3w powalisz.\nNiestety, u\u017Cycie
      supermocy na pewno Ci\u0119 troch\u0119 zm\u0119czy.\nNie b\u0119dziesz mie\u0107
      si\u0142y na takie szybkie i mocne strza\u0142y.\nPo czasie, wszystko wr\xF3ci
      do normy. Zaczynajmy!"
  - key: tutorial.level7.line0
    english: 'Wow, that was amazing! You''re making progress!

      It''s time for
      the unsconsciousness.

      Here lay all the events, that you pushed away
      from the upper levels.

      Including your encounter with elephants.

      Good
      thing that you got out alright that time. That was close.

      Elephants
      went wild a bit from that time. They''re very dangerous.

      It''s the unconsciousness,
      after all.

      Remember that your Superpower regenerates!

      Good luck!'
    polish: "Wow, to by\u0142o wspania\u0142e! Robisz post\u0119py!\nChyba pora na
      nie\u015Bwiadomo\u015B\u0107.\nS\u0105 tutaj wszystkie zdarzenia, kt\xF3re
      wypar\u0142e\u015B z g\xF3rnych warstw.\nW\u015Br\xF3d nich Twoje spotkanie
      ze s\u0142oniami.\nDobrze, \u017Ce nic Ci si\u0119 wtedy nie sta\u0142o. By\u0142o
      blisko.\nS\u0142onie troch\u0119 zdzicza\u0142y od tego czasu. S\u0105 bardzo
      niebezpieczne.\nTo w ko\u0144cu nie\u015Bwiadomo\u015B\u0107.\nPami\u0119taj
      o tym, \u017Ce Supermoc si\u0119 regeneruje!\nPowodzenia!"
  - key: tutorial.level9.line0
    english: "Somebody wants to fight his fears!\nAnd that's the attitude we like!\nYes,
      yes! You got it right.\nYour memory troubles are related directly \nto your
      biggest phobias.\nYou know what it means.\nMister Nightmare.\nHe's been sitting
      there for a long time.\nIt's time to drive him out once and for all, and get
      some peace.\nRemember, all other monsters support his reign.\nIf you hurt him,
      they will rush to his aid."
    polish: "Kto\u015B tu chce pozby\u0107 si\u0119 swoich l\u0119k\xF3w!\nI to nam
      si\u0119 podoba!\nTak, tak! Dobrze rozumiesz,\nTwoje problemy z pami\u0119ci\u0105
      wi\u0105\u017C\u0105 si\u0119 bezpo\u015Brednio\nz Twoimi najwi\u0119kszym
      l\u0119kami.\nWiesz, co to oznacza.\nPan Koszmarek.\nSiedzi tam ju\u017C od
      d\u0142u\u017Cszego czasu.\nPora wykurzy\u0107 go z mieszkania i zazna\u0107
      troch\u0119 spokoju.\nPamietaj, \u017Ce wszystkie potworki popieraj\u0105 jego
      rz\u0105dy.\nJe\u015Bli go skrzywdzisz, przyb\u0119d\u0105 mu na pomoc."
  - key: zeroLvl.alert1
    english: "Hello, it's us again! \nWe'll explain some things to you."
    polish: "Cze\u015B\u0107, to znowu my!\nWyja\u015Bnimy Ci kilka kwestii."
  - key: zeroLvl.alert2
    english: This element indicates your health.
    polish: "Ten element wskazuje Twoje \u017Cycie."
  - key: zeroLvl.alert3
    english: This one shows your score.
    polish: "Ten poka\u017Ce Ci Tw\xF3j wynik."
  - key: zeroLvl.alert4
    english: 'And here you can see your Superpower level.

      But more on this
      later.'
    polish: "A tutaj widzisz SuperMoc.\nAle o tym b\u0119dzie p\xF3\u017Aniej."
  - key: zeroLvl.alert5
    english: 'We now unlock your movement.

      Use the analogue sticks!'
    polish: "Odblokowujemy mo\u017Cliwo\u015B\u0107 poruszania si\u0119.\nU\u017Cyj
      joystick\xF3w kontrolera!"
  - key: zeroLvl.alert6
    english: "Left stick is for movement, \nright is for turning around."
    polish: "Lewy joystick to ruch,\nprawy joystick to obr\xF3t."
  - key: zeroLvl.alert7
    english: "Go on, get moving! \nJust don't break anything!"
    polish: "No, \u015Bmia\u0142o, ruszaj si\u0119!\nTylko niczego nie zepsuj!"
  - key: zeroLvl.alert8
    english: "In order to collect points you can pick up\n yellow shiny stars. \nJust
      walk through them."
    polish: "Aby zdobywa\u0107 punkty mo\u017Cesz zbiera\u0107\n \u017C\xF3\u0142te,
      \u015Bwiec\u0105ce gwiazdki.\nPo prostu w nie wejd\u017A."
  - key: zeroLvl.alert9
    english: You can also kill the enemies.
    polish: "Mo\u017Cesz te\u017C zabija\u0107 przeciwnik\xF3w."
  - key: zeroLvl.alert10
    english: "Just press \nR2 on the back of the game pad (right trigger). \nTo finish
      them off, shoot a few times."
    polish: "Po prostu naci\u015Bnij\nprzycisk R2 z ty\u0142u pada (prawy trigger).\nAby
      ich wyko\u0144czy\u0107, strzel kilka razy."
  - key: zeroLvl.alert11
    english: "Remember, it's all in your head. \nYou'll never run out of ammo."
    polish: "Pami\u0119taj, \u017Ce to Twoja g\u0142owa.\nAmunicja nie sko\u0144czy
      si\u0119 nigdy."
  - key: zeroLvl.alert12
    english: "You get less points for stars than \nfor killing the enemies."
    polish: "Za gwiazdki dostaniesz mniej punkt\xF3w ni\u017C\nza eliminowanie przeciwnik\xF3w."
  - key: zeroLvl.alert13
    english: "And pay attention to the score. \nIt keeps changing, you know."
    polish: "I zwr\xF3\u0107 uwag\u0119 na informacj\u0119 o punktach.\nBo wiesz,
      ona si\u0119 zmienia."
  - key: zeroLvl.alert14
    english: "To get to the next level, \nyou need to collect required points."
    polish: "Aby awansowa\u0107 na kolejne poziomy\nmusisz zebra\u0107 wystarczaj\u0105c\u0105
      liczb\u0119 punkt\xF3w."
  - key: zeroLvl.alert15
    english: We won't tell you how many exactly, though.
    polish: Ale nie powiemy Ci ile.
  - key: zeroLvl.alert16
    english: "To complete the training, collect all stars \nor kill all enemies."
    polish: "Aby zako\u0144czy\u0107 szkolenie zbierz wszystkie gwiazdki\nlub zniszcz
      wszystkich przeciwnik\xF3w."
  - key: zeroLvl.alert17
    english: "These ones are harmless. \nBut you better watch out for the real ones!"
    polish: "Ci tutaj s\u0105 niegro\u017Ani.\nAle na prawdziwych lepiej uwa\u017Caj!"
  - key: zeroLvl.alert18
    english: 'The darker they are,

      the stronger they hit you.'
    polish: "Im s\u0105 ciemniejsi,\ntym s\u0105 silniejsi."
  - key: zeroLvl.alert19
    english: Good luck and see you soon!
    polish: "Powodzenia i do zobaczenia nied\u0142ugo!"
  - key: intro.welcome
    english: Welcome in the Freud2.0!
    polish: Witaj w Freud2.0!
  - key: intro.timeLabel
    english: 'Time to level begin: '
    polish: "Czas do rozpocz\u0119cia poziomu: "
  - key: end.timeLabel
    english: 'Time to show results: '
    polish: "Czas za jaki poka\u017Cemy Ci wyniki: "
  - key: gameover.text
    english: 'You lost!

      The level will restart in: '
    polish: "Przegra\u0142e\u015B!\nRestart poziomu za: "
  - key: alert.moreMonsters
    english: 'More and more monsters are coming!

      Watch out!'
    polish: "Nadchodz\u0105 kolejne potwory!\nUwa\u017Caj!"
  - key: alert.nightmareSupport
    english: Supporters are coming! Watch out!
    polish: "Przyzwano sojusznik\xF3w! Uwa\u017Caj!"
  - key: scoreboard.close
    english: "<color=red>Your name: {0}.\n Your score: {1}.\n</color> The game will
      end in: "
    polish: "<color=red>Twoja nazwa: {0}.\n Tw\xF3j wynik: {1}.\n</color> Gra zako\u0144czy
      si\u0119 za: "
